        "title": "波音777X防止翼展折疊起飛的安全設計",
        "summary": "波音777X設計會阻止機師在翼展折疊時起飛，以確保安全的",
        "body": [
          "波音777X的設計包含防止翼展折疊時起飛的機制，系統會在起飛前檢測翼展狀態，這項機制是為了避免因翼未展開而導致的失速或結構損傷。",
          "如果機師嘗試在翼仍處於折疊狀態下起飛，系統會阻止起飛指令，並提示機組人員展開機翼，此保護措施在飛行控制電腦中實施，確保任何未展開的機翼都會觸發警告。",
          "此安全功能確保在起飛前翼展已完全展開，提升飛行安全，符合認證要求，此功能亦獲航空公司與監管機構肯定，認為它提升了大型寬體客機的操作安全，未來的機型也預計採用相同的防護機制。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Boeing 777X Prevents Takeoff With Wings Still Folded",
        "summary": "Boeing 777X includes a system that blocks takeoff if wings remain folded.",
        "body": [
          "The Boeing 777X is built with a system that prevents takeoff while the wings are still folded, and the system checks wing deployment before departure.",
          "If a pilot attempts to initiate takeoff with folded wings, the aircraft will block the takeoff command and alert the crew to extend the wings, a protection implemented in the flight control computers to trigger a warning for any un‑deployed wing.",
          "This safety feature ensures the wings are fully deployed before takeoff, enhancing flight safety and meeting certification requirements; it has been praised by airlines and regulators as improving the operational safety of large wide‑body jets, and future models are expected to adopt the same protection."
        ]
      },
